    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIODACITY: THE MANSION keeps its horror tense through atmosphere, inspired by \u2018Resident Evil\u2019, \u2018Amnesia\u2019, and similar horror titles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your way through a crooked Mansion in the aftermath of an apocalypse. Biological mutants ravaged the Earth! You are responsible for finding crucial information! Fight horrific creatures that lurk around every corner! Find and upgrade your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are tasked with discovering information about the Biomutants, leading you to a strange mansion out in the middle of nowhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sharp Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge and fight for your survival! There is a variety of enemies with all types of different attacks! Be aware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/59b378962c640ab17c4e522472fdb633.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/59b378962c640ab17c4e522472fdb633.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/59b378962c640ab17c4e522472fdb633.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Difficulty and Unique Playthroughs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each difficulty comes with different enemy placement, changes in loot, and makes the enemies more aggressive and difficult! This ensures that playing on a harder difficulty will be like playing an entirely different game. In addition to this, some of the loot is randomized to make sure that every playthrough is unique.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every nook and cranny will need to be searched to upgrade your gear! This Mansion offers many secrets in the form of loot or upgrades. You\u2019ll want to explore it and solve all of its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/8a37c50c82d91460dbcbdafb1f76287c.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/8a37c50c82d91460dbcbdafb1f76287c.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/8a37c50c82d91460dbcbdafb1f76287c.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scraping by every combat encounter with little health left! Crafting the necessary ingredients will allow you to manage your resources better as well as crafting ammo for a specific gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/a99e774bb124d63a274196f5918b0eec.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/a99e774bb124d63a274196f5918b0eec.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/a99e774bb124d63a274196f5918b0eec.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arsenal Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which weapons will you use? Will you find the upgrades for them? There are many weapons to choose from, all with their unique ranges and stats. Building a unique arsenal will be ideal for making it out of The Mansion alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/46c7134f57d08259e7d07d507c0013b7.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/46c7134f57d08259e7d07d507c0013b7.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/46c7134f57d08259e7d07d507c0013b7.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Game Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play well you\u2019ll unlock better things for next time! There are unlocks that add new items and features to spice up your experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mansion and its secrets will take you upwards of 6 hours to complete\u2026 and even then the exploration is not over! Completing the game with certain limitations will unlock new items and features!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIODACITY: THE MANSION keeps its horror tense through atmosphere, inspired by \u2018Resident Evil\u2019, \u2018Amnesia\u2019, and similar horror titles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your way through a crooked Mansion in the aftermath of an apocalypse. Biological mutants ravaged the Earth! You are responsible for finding crucial information! Fight horrific creatures that lurk around every corner! Find and upgrade your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are tasked with discovering information about the Biomutants, leading you to a strange mansion out in the middle of nowhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sharp Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge and fight for your survival! There is a variety of enemies with all types of different attacks! Be aware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/59b378962c640ab17c4e522472fdb633.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/59b378962c640ab17c4e522472fdb633.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/59b378962c640ab17c4e522472fdb633.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Difficulty and Unique Playthroughs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each difficulty comes with different enemy placement, changes in loot, and makes the enemies more aggressive and difficult! This ensures that playing on a harder difficulty will be like playing an entirely different game. In addition to this, some of the loot is randomized to make sure that every playthrough is unique.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every nook and cranny will need to be searched to upgrade your gear! This Mansion offers many secrets in the form of loot or upgrades. You\u2019ll want to explore it and solve all of its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/8a37c50c82d91460dbcbdafb1f76287c.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/8a37c50c82d91460dbcbdafb1f76287c.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/8a37c50c82d91460dbcbdafb1f76287c.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scraping by every combat encounter with little health left! Crafting the necessary ingredients will allow you to manage your resources better as well as crafting ammo for a specific gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/a99e774bb124d63a274196f5918b0eec.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/a99e774bb124d63a274196f5918b0eec.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/a99e774bb124d63a274196f5918b0eec.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arsenal Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which weapons will you use? Will you find the upgrades for them? There are many weapons to choose from, all with their unique ranges and stats. Building a unique arsenal will be ideal for making it out of The Mansion alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/46c7134f57d08259e7d07d507c0013b7.poster.avif?t=1744988204\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/46c7134f57d08259e7d07d507c0013b7.webm?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234440/extras/46c7134f57d08259e7d07d507c0013b7.mp4?t=1744988204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Game Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play well you\u2019ll unlock better things for next time! There are unlocks that add new items and features to spice up your experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mansion and its secrets will take you upwards of 6 hours to complete\u2026 and even then the exploration is not over! Completing the game with certain limitations will unlock new items and features!</p>",
